WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:03.189
打开Rules / Open Rules

2
00:00:03.189 --> 00:00:06.256
创建初始规则 / Create the initial Rule

3
00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:09.246
命名Guide initial / Name it Guide initial

4
00:00:09.246 --> 00:00:12.249
限定127.0.0.1 / Restrict to 127.0.0.1

5
00:00:12.249 --> 00:00:15.604
添加Path条件 / Add a Path condition

6
00:00:15.604 --> 00:00:18.617
限定冲突演示路径 / Restrict the conflict example paths

7
00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:21.620
填写x-guide-conflict / Enter x-guide-conflict

8
00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.623
填写initial / Enter initial

9
00:00:24.623 --> 00:00:27.644
启用初始规则 / Enable the initial Rule

10
00:00:27.644 --> 00:00:30.716
Apply初始版本 / Apply the initial revision

11
00:00:30.716 --> 00:00:33.724
留下本地名称草稿 / Leave a local name draft

12
00:00:33.724 --> 00:00:36.742
留下未Apply的local值 / Leave an unapplied local value

13
00:00:36.742 --> 00:00:39.845
检查第二写入者的实际Ask审批 / Inspect the second writer’s actual Ask approval

14
00:00:39.845 --> 00:00:42.902
允许第二写入者保存remote / Allow the second writer to save remote

15
00:00:42.902 --> 00:00:45.898
核对本地草稿没有被静默覆盖 / Verify the local draft was not silently overwritten

16
00:00:45.898 --> 00:00:48.894
核对新请求实际使用remote / Verify new traffic actually uses remote

17
00:00:48.894 --> 00:00:51.969
明确Reload放弃本地草稿 / Explicitly Reload and discard the local draft

18
00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:54.992
基于新版本填写Guide merged / Enter Guide merged based on the new revision

19
00:00:54.992 --> 00:00:57.996
填写merged值 / Enter the merged value

20
00:00:57.996 --> 00:01:01.064
Apply新的编辑 / Apply the new edits

21
00:01:01.064 --> 00:01:04.044
核对新请求使用merged / Verify a new request uses merged

22
00:01:04.044 --> 00:01:07.071
停用演示规则 / Disable the example Rule

23
00:01:07.071 --> 00:01:10.107
Apply停用状态 / Apply the disabled state

24
00:01:10.107 --> 00:01:13.438
返回MCP设置收尾 / Return to MCP settings for cleanup

25
00:01:13.438 --> 00:01:16.482
关闭本轮MCP Server / Stop this run’s MCP Server
